<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-Bunas says first half net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Bunas says first half net up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			 (in billion rupiah except per share)</p>
<p>    Net income			25.41	  vs    13.37</p>
<p>    Earnings per share  (rph)    147	   vs     232</p>
<p>    Revenues			  132.53	 vs   83.50</p>
<p>    Expenses			  96.26	  vs   65.68</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  36.27	  vs   17.83</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	     72.71	  vs   34.73</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Bunas Finance Indonesia is multifinance firm, with interests including in factoring, consumer financing and leasing.</p>
